OL,3,ATrump announces deal for Russian diesel
OL,4,Aas Zelensky criticises 'gift to Putin'
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump says he has
OL,7,Freached an agreement with Russian
OL,8,FPresident Vladimir Putin allowing
OL,9,FMoscow to "immediately release" diesel
OL,10,Fto the US and globally.
OL,12,FTrump said the proposed release of
OL,13,Fhundreds of thousands of tonnes of
OL,14,FRussian diesel, in tranches, would see
OL,15,Fprices "COMING DOWN, IN RECORD NUMBERS,
OL,16,FAND FAST!".
OL,18,FIt is understood the US Treasury is
OL,19,Fsuspending sanctions on Russian diesel
OL,20,Fexports until 7 April 2027 as part of
OL,21,Fthe deal, but other assets like those
OL,22,Fin American banks are still frozen.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
