OL,3,ATrump announces deal for Russian diesel
OL,4,Aas Zelensky criticises 'gift to Putin'
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkraine's president criticised the
OL,7,Fdecision, saying any easing of
OL,8,Fsanctions on Russia played into
OL,9,FMoscow's hands and would prolong the
OL,10,Fwar between the two countries.
